9;s:12:\"Post updated\";i:400;s:13:\"Spam Detected\";i:401;s:69:\"The changes you made will be lost if you navigate away from this page\";i:402;s:21:\"Uploaded to this post\";i:403;s:14:\"Expand Details\";i:404;s:16:\"Collapse Details\";i:405;s:10:\"Restricted\";i:406;s:21:\"Validation successful\";i:407;s:26:\"1 field requires attention\";i:408;s:27:\"%d fields require attention\";i:409;s:13:\"Are you sure?\";i:410;s:6:\"Cancel\";i:411;s:13:\"Has any value\";i:412;s:12:\"Has no value\";i:413;s:17:\"Value is equal to\";i:414;s:21:\"Value is not equal to\";i:415;s:21:\"Value matches pattern\";i:416;s:14:\"Value contains\";i:417;s:21:\"Value is greater than\";i:418;s:18:\"Value is less than\";i:419;s:25:\"Selection is greater than\";i:420;s:22:\"Selection is less than\";i:421;s:5:\"Basic\";i:422;s:6:\"Choice\";i:423;s:10:\"Relational\";i:424;s:6:\"jQuery\";i:425;s:14:\"Sync available\";i:426;s:11:\"Description\";i:427;s:6:\"Fields\";i:428;s:69:\"Customise WordPress with powerful, professional and intuitive fields.\";i:429;s:9:\"Changelog\";i:430;s:47:\"See what\\\'s new in <a href=\"%s\">version %s</a>.\";i:431;s:9:\"Resources\";i:432;s:7:\"Website\";i:433;s:13:\"Documentation\";i:434;s:7:\"Support\";i:435;s:3:\"Pro\";i:436;s:49:\"Thank you for creating with <a href=\"%s\">ACF</a>.\";i:437;s:19:\"Duplicate this item\";i:438;s:9:\"Duplicate\";i:439;s:23:\"Synchronise field group\";i:440;s:4:\"Sync\";i:441;s:5:\"Apply\";i:442;s:12:\"Bulk Actions\";i:443;s:16:\"Upgrade Database\";i:444;s:22:\"Review sites & upgrade\";i:445;s:20:\"Field group updated.\";i:446;s:20:\"Field group deleted.\";i:447;s:22:\"Field group published.\";i:448;s:18:\"Field group saved.\";i:449;s:22:\"Field group submitted.\";i:450;s:26:\"Field group scheduled for.\";i:451;s:26:\"Field group draft updated.\";i:452;s:64:\"The string \"field_\" may not be used at the start of a field name\";i:453;s:60:\"This field cannot be moved until its changes have been saved\";i:454;s:29:\"Field group title is required\";i:455;s:28:\"Move to trash. Are you sure?\";i:456;s:26:\"No toggle fields available\";i:457;s:17:\"Move Custom Field\";i:458;s:7:\"Checked\";i:459;s:12:\"(this field)\";i:460;s:4:\"Null\";i:461;s:8:\"Location\";i:462;s:8:\"Settings\";i:463;s:10:\"Field Keys\";i:464;s:6:\"Active\";i:465;s:8:\"Inactive\";i:466;s:14:\"Move Complete.\";i:467;s:51:\"The %s field can now be found in the %s field group\";i:468;s:12:\"Close Window\";i:469;s:44:\"Please select the destination for this field\";i:470;s:10:\"Move Field\";i:471;s:24:\"Show this field group if\";i:472;s:17:\"Conditional Logic\";i:473;s:18:\"Show this field if\";i:474;s:3:\"and\";i:475;s:14:\"Add rule group\";i:476;s:15:\"Drag to reorder\";i:477;s:10:\"Edit field\";i:478;s:15:\"Duplicate field\";i:479;s:27:\"Move field to another group\";i:480;s:4:\"Move\";i:481;s:12:\"Delete field\";i:482;s:6:\"Delete\";i:483;s:11:\"Field Label\";i:484;s:51:\"This is the name which will appear on the EDIT page\";i:485;s:10:\"Field Name\";i:486;s:54:\"Single word, no spaces. Underscores and dashes allowed\";i:487;s:10:\"Field Type\";i:488;s:52:\"Instructions for authors. Shown when submitting data\";i:489;s:9:\"Required?\";i:490;s:18:\"Wrapper Attributes\";i:491;s:5:\"width\";i:492;s:5:\"class\";i:493;s:2:\"id\";i:494;s:11:\"Close Field\";i:495;s:5:\"Rules\";i:496;s:91:\"Create a set of rules to determine which edit screens will use these advanced custom fields\";i:497;s:8:\"Repeater\";i:498;s:16:\"Flexible Content\";i:499;s:7:\"Gallery\";i:500;s:12:\"Options Page\";i:501;s:25:\"Database Upgrade Required\";i:502;s:76:\"This version contains improvements to your database and requires an upgrade.\";i:503;s:121:\"It is strongly recommended that you backup your database before proceeding. Are you sure you wish to run the updater now?\";i:504;s:94:\"The following sites require a DB upgrade. Check the ones you want to update and then click %s.\";i:505;s:13:\"Upgrade Sites\";i:506;s:4:\"Site\";i:507;s:18:\"Site is up to date\";i:508;s:71:\"Database Upgrade complete. <a href=\"%s\">Return to network dashboard</a>\";i:509;s:43:\"Please select at least one site to upgrade.\";i:510;s:17:\"Upgrade complete.\";i:511;s:15:\"Upgrade failed.\";i:512;s:33:\"Welcome to Advanced Custom Fields\";i:513;s:21:\"A Smoother Experience\";i:514;s:18:\"Improved Usability\";i:515;s:161:\"Including the popular Select2 library has improved both usability and speed across a number of field types including post object, page link, taxonomy and select.\";i:516;s:15:\"Improved Design\";i:517;s:160:\"Many fields have undergone a visual refresh to make ACF look better than ever! Noticeable changes are seen on the gallery, relationship and oEmbed (new) fields!\";i:518;s:13:\"Improved Data\";i:519;s:167:\"Redesigning the data architecture has allowed sub fields to live independently from their parents. This allows you to drag and drop fields in and out of parent fields!\";i:520;s:26:\"Goodbye Add-ons. Hello PRO\";i:521;s:19:\"Introducing ACF PRO\";i:522;s:77:\"We\'re changing the way premium functionality is delivered in an exciting way!\";i:523;s:17:\"Powerful Features\";i:524;s:164:\"ACF PRO contains powerful features such as repeatable data, flexible content layouts, a beautiful gallery field and the ability to create extra admin options pages!\";i:525;s:14:\"Easy Upgrading\";i:526;s:87:\"Upgrading to ACF PRO is easy. Simply purchase a license online and download the plugin!\";i:527;s:12:\"New Features\";i:528;s:10:\"Link Field\";i:529;s:85:\"The Link field provides a simple way to select or define a link (url, title, target).\";i:530;s:11:\"Group Field\";i:531;s:66:\"The Group field provides a simple way to create a group of fields.\";i:532;s:12:\"oEmbed Field\";i:533;s:94:\"The oEmbed field allows an easy way to embed videos, images, tweets, audio, and other content.\";i:534;s:11:\"Clone Field\";i:535;s:65:\"The clone field allows you to select and display existing fields.\";i:536;s:9:\"More AJAX\";i:537;s:61:\"More fields use AJAX powered search to speed up page loading.\";i:538;s:10:\"Local JSON\";i:539;s:77:\"New auto export to JSON feature improves speed and allows for syncronisation.\";i:540;s:20:\"Easy Import / Export\";i:541;s:67:\"Both import and export can easily be done through a new tools page.\";i:542;s:18:\"New Form Locations\";i:543;s:84:\"Fields can now be mapped to menus, menu items, comments, widgets and all user forms!\";i:544;s:18:\"More Customization\";i:545;s:85:\"New PHP (and JS) actions and filters have been added to allow for more customization.\";i:546;s:8:\"Fresh UI\";i:547;s:90:\"The entire plugin has had a design refresh including new field types, settings and design!\";i:548;s:12:\"New Settings\";i:549;s:105:\"Field group settings have been added for Active, Label Placement, Instructions Placement and Description.\";i:550;s:22:\"Better Front End Forms\";i:551;s:77:\"acf_form() can now create a new post on submission with lots of new settings.\";i:552;s:17:\"Better Validation\";i:553;s:64:\"Form validation is now done via PHP + AJAX in favour of only JS.\";i:554;s:13:\"Moving Fields\";i:555;s:82:\"New field group functionality allows you to move a field between groups & parents.\";i:556;s:5:\"Style\";i:557;s:21:\"Standard (WP metabox)\";i:558;s:21:\"Seamless (no metabox)\";i:559;s:8:\"Position\";i:560;s:18:\"High (after title)\";i:561;s:22:\"Normal (after content)\";i:562;s:4:\"Side\";i:563;s:15:\"Label placement\";i:564;s:21:\"Instruction placement\";i:565;s:12:\"Below labels\";i:566;s:12:\"Below fields\";i:567;s:9:\"Order No.\";i:568;s:49:\"Field groups with a lower order will appear first\";i:569;s:25:\"Shown in field group list\";i:570;s:9:\"Permalink\";i:571;s:14:\"Content Editor\";i:572;s:7:\"Excerpt\";i:573;s:13:\"Custom Fields\";i:574;s:10:\"Discussion\";i:575;s:8:\"Comments\";i:576;s:9:\"Revisions\";i:577;s:4:\"Slug\";i:578;s:6:\"Author\";i:579;s:6:\"Format\";i:580;s:15:\"Page Attributes\";i:581;s:4:\"Tags\";i:582;s:15:\"Send Trackbacks\";i:583;s:14:\"Hide on screen\";i:584;s:61:\"<b>Select</b> items to <b>hide</b> them from the edit screen.\";i:585;s:134:\"If multiple field groups appear on an edit screen, the first field group\'s options will be used (the one with the lowest order number)\";i:586;s:7:\"Add-ons\";i:587;s:18:\"Download & Install\";i:588;s:9:\"Installed\";i:589;s:5:\"Order\";i:590;s:3:\"Key\";i:591;s:4:\"Type\";i:592;s:84:\"No fields. Click the <strong>+ Add Field</strong> button to create your first field.\";i:593;s:11:\"+ Add Field\";i:594;s:9:\"New Field\";i:595;s:24:\"Reading upgrade tasks...\";i:596;s:59:\"Database upgrade complete. <a href=\"%s\">See what\\\'s new</a>\";i:597;s:21:\"No updates available.\";i:598;s:5:\"Tools\";i:599;s:4:\"Info\";i:600;s:10:\"What\'s New\";i:601;s:19:\"Import Field Groups\";i:602;s:143:\"Select the Advanced Custom Fields JSON file you would like to import. When you click the import button below, ACF will import the field groups.\";i:603;s:11:\"Import File\";i:604;s:19:\"Export Field Groups\";i:605;s:12:\"Generate PHP\";i:606;s:24:\"No field groups selected\";i:607;s:19:\"Select Field Groups\";i:608;s:14:\"Empty settings\";i:609;s:270:\"Select the field groups you would like to export and then select your export method. Use the download button to export to a .json file which you can then import to another ACF installation. Use the generate button to export to PHP code which you can place in your theme.\";i:610;s:11:\"Export File\";i:611;s:321:\"The following code can be used to register a local version of the selected field group(s). A local field group can provide many benefits such as faster load times, version control & dynamic fields/settings. Simply copy and paste the following code to your theme\'s functions.php file or include it within an external file.\";i:612;s:17:\"Copy to clipboard\";i:613;s:6:\"Copied\";i:614;s:12:\"Field Groups\";i:615;s:7:\"Add New\";i:616;s:22:\"Advanced Custom Fields\";i:617;s:11:\"Field Group\";i:618;s:19:\"Add New Fi