(3422, 22, 'reviewsMain_0_textReview', 'From may 28 we live at apartments on Leningradskoe Highway. Actual photos - great furniture, two big beds - two adults and two childrens beautifully accommodated, the kitchen is fully equipped, comfortable bathroom. Very convenient location, metro is near, 5-7 min afoot calm step. We so glad! Thanks to the manager Natalya, she meet us and conducted to home. I will recommend your company to my friends and acquaintances. Thank you very much. 23 of June we come to Moscow and again we turn to your company.\r\n\r\nReviewed in our group Vkontakte'),
(10956, 807, 'descr_type', 'We take care about your comfort. Be sure that you will not be left without shelter. Enjoy the service and feel at home.\r\n\r\nWe have many apartments, from standard to luxury level and two-storey.'),
