(11103, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_1_descr', '<strong>Allowed</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>spend time at home with family</li>\r\n 	<li>cook food on the stove and in the oven</li>\r\n 	<li>washing clothes in a washing machine</li>\r\n 	<li>smoke on the balcony with the door closed</li>\r\n 	<li>use internet and cable tv</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Prohibited</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>parties at home</li>\r\n 	<li>celebrate holidays</li>\r\n 	<li>smoking in the apartment</li>\r\n 	<li>litter in the apartment</li>\r\n 	<li>make noise in the apartment</li>\r\n 	<li>carelessly treat property in an apartment</li>\r\n 	<li>the presence of more people than in the contract</li>\r\n</ul>'),
(11104, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_1', ''),
(11105, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_2_title', 'Free services'),
(11106, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_2_img', '305'),
(11107, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_2_descr', '<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Linens</strong>\r\nWe suggest one bed linen to one bed. The coast of using extra linens is 200 rubles and towel 100 rubles.\r\n<strong>Movie collection</strong>\r\nEach apartment has a flash drive with free movies, on which about 20 interesting movies of different genres. For the flash drive we take 700 rub. deposit and return it when you check-out.\r\n<strong>Wi-fi internet and cable TV</strong>\r\nEach apartment has a memo with a password of Wi-Fi.</p>'),
(11946, 818, 'rooms', '1'),
(11947, 818, 'sleeping_places', '4'),
(11108, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_2', ''),
(11109, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_3_title', 'Paid services'),
(11110, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_3_img', '304'),
(11111, 809, 'additional_information_banners_blok_3_descr', '<strong>Rent of play station</strong>\r\nRent a X-box 360 or Sony Play Station with installed\r\ngames and two joysticks. The cost of rental of 1000 rubles for the first\r\nday and only 100 rubles for each subsequent.\r\n<strong>New bedding set</strong>\r\nFor you, we can buy a new set of bed linen from IKEA size 2 м * 2 м. Linens in new packaging. The cost of this service is only 500 rubles for the entire stay.'),
